  <h2>Worry-Free Importing: The DDP Advantage</h2>
  <p>For many international brand owners, the biggest headache isn't manufacturing—it's logistics. Dealing with customs, import duties, and local port clearance can be overwhelming. This is why <strong>DDP (Delivered Duty Paid)</strong> has become the gold standard for B2B activewear importing.</p>
  
  <h3>What is DDP?</h3>
  <p>DDP is a shipping agreement where the manufacturer (FITCLO) takes full responsibility for the goods until they arrive at your door. This includes all shipping costs, export/import duties, taxes, and customs clearance fees. You pay one flat rate, and we handle the rest.</p>

  <h3>Why Our Clients Choose DDP</h3>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-4 my-6 text-gray-700">
    <li><strong>Predictable Pricing:</strong> No surprise hidden fees or local port charges. You know your landed cost before production even starts.</li>
    <li><strong>Zero Paperwork:</strong> We handle the complex documentation required for international customs, saving you hours of administrative work.</li>
    <li><strong>Amazon FBA Ready:</strong> We can ship directly from our factory floor to Amazon warehouses globally, fully compliant with FBA standards.</li>
  </ul>

